163
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,780
Vem logo!

164
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:15,780
Tohsaka?

165
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,580
Não precisa nem dizer, eu te entendo,

166
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:24,830
